<title>POLAND: Polish NBP-bill 91-,273-day yields flat at tender.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP-bill 91-,273-day yields flat at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 221 million zlotys of 91-day NBP-bills at an unchanged average yield of 22.20 percent after Polish banks bid for 221 million of the paper, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The NBP also sold 200 million zloty of 273-day NBP-bills at an unchanged average yield of 22.00 percent after banks bid for 234 million.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
